OL,3,GNEWSACity status will not be lost in
OL,4,Ashake-up - minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city's status will not be lost as a
OL,7,Fresult of local authority
OL,8,Freorganisation, the government has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FGloucester attained city status
OL,12,Ffollowing the dissolution of the
OL,13,Fmonasteries and the subsequent
OL,14,Ftransformation of St Peter's Abbey into
OL,15,Fa cathedral in 1541.
OL,17,FBut councillors are concerned this
OL,18,Fcould be lost or removed during a
OL,19,Fproposed council shake-up that will see
OL,20,FGloucester City Council abolished and
OL,21,Fmerged with six Gloucestershire
OL,22,Fdistricts to become a "super council".
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
