OL,3,GNEWSACity status will not be lost in
OL,4,Ashake-up - minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal government minister Jim McMahon
OL,7,Fhas said the government will do
OL,8,Fwhatever it has to do "to ensure no
OL,9,Fcity loses its city status through
OL,10,Freorganisation".
